ame><address><country>JP</country> </address> </addressbook> </applicant><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>MATSUSHITA ELECTRIC IND CO LTD</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>SHI GUIZENG</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>UESUGI MITSURU</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>KATO, OSAMU</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>MATSUSHITA ELECTRIC INDUSTRIAL CO., LTD.</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>SHI, GUIZENG</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>UESUGI, MITSURU</name></addressbook></applicant></applicants><inventors><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>KATO OSAMU</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>SHI GUIZENG</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>UESUGI MITSURU</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>KATO, OSAMU</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>SHI, GUIZENG</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>UESUGI, MITSURU</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>Line condition notifying information of a down channel (206) is transmitted as a feedback signal to the destination station while permitting a lowered transmission efficiency of an up channel (202). While the radio line condition of the down channel (206) is poor, the destination station temporarily delays data transmission on receiving the line condition notifying information, thereby preventing unnecessary retransmission and easing channel contention. Data transmission is resumed when the line condition of the transmission line (206) returns to normal.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>L'invention concerne un dispositif et un procédé permettant la transmission à la station destinataire d'une l'information indiquant l'état le la ligne dans un canal (206) descendant sous forme d'un signal de rétroaction, tout en assurant une transmission à rendement diminué dans un canal (202) montant. Lorsque l'état de la ligne radio est mauvais, la station destinataire diffère temporairement l'émission de données suite à la réception de l'information indiquant l'état de la ligne ce qui permet d'éviter des retransmissions inutiles et de réduire les conflits de canaux. La transmission des donnée est reprise dès que l'état de la ligne (206) de transmission redevient normal.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>